  // DOD-M12B-TESTS-NOT-TYPECHECKED-1 — this package's tests ARE type-checked.
  //
  // `tsconfig.json` excludes `src/__tests__` from `tsc --build`, so without this a test asserting on
  // a field that does not exist, or calling a method that was removed, is invisible to the gate: it
